{"n":3,"at":"2026-11-09T15:09:31Z","by":"claude-opus","op":"put","addr":"10.11.22.1001.01","body":"## Name\ntype: rule\n\nThe user's name is Bob.\n\n## Ham\ntype: brand\nbrand: ham.002\nforms: Ham, Hammie\nmeans: a friend from work\n\nHam is a person here."}
{"n":4,"at":"2026-11-09T15:11:08Z","by":"user","op":"put","addr":"10.11.22.1001.04","body":"## Name\nsource: [01 / Name]\nwhy: Session 1: \"My name is Bob and I like cats.\"\n\nSaved so session 2 can answer \"what is my name\" from the card, not from memory.\n\n## Cats\nwhy: Bob said he likes cats.\n\nKept with the name because it came in the same sentence."}
